#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Gcr"
msgstr "Instalação do Gcr"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Both gcr-3 and gcr-4 are coinstallable. This version of the package is used "
"to support GTK-4 applications, such as <xref linkend=\"gnome-shell\" "
"role=\"nodep\"/> and <xref linkend=\"epiphany\" role=\"nodep\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ambos, gcr-3 e gcr-4, são co instaláveis. Essa versão do pacote é usada para"
" suportar aplicativos GTK-4, como o <xref linkend=\"gnome-shell\" "
"role=\"nodep\"/>e <xref linkend=\"epiphany\" role=\"nodep\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Gcr</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Gcr</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:114
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D gtk_doc=false    \\\n"
"            -D ssh_agent=false  \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D gtk_doc=false    \\\n"
"            -D ssh_agent=false  \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> installed and wish to build the API "
"documentation for this package, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> instalado e desejar construir a "
"documentação da API para esse pacote, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:129
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"/install_dir/s@,\\$@ / 'gcr-&gcr4-version;'&amp;@\" \\\n"
"    -i ../docs/*/meson.build                 &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D gtk_doc=true              &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"/install_dir/s@,\\$@ / 'gcr-&gcr4-version;'&amp;@\" \\\n"
"    -i ../docs/*/meson.build                 &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D gtk_doc=true              &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>.  The tests must "
"be run from an X Terminal or similar."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>. Os testes "
"precisam ser executados a partir de um Terminal do X ou similar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:143
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D gtk4=false</option>: Use this switch if you haven't installed "
"<xref linkend=\"gtk4\"/>. Note that <application>gcr-viewer-"
"gtk4</application> will not be installed if this is passed to meson."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D gtk4=false</option>: Use essa chave se você não tiver instalado "
"<xref linkend=\"gtk4\"/>. Observe que <application>gcr-viewer-"
"gtk4</application> não será instalado se isso for passado para meson."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>-D gtk_doc=false</parameter>: &gi-doc-disable;"
msgstr "<parameter>-D gtk_doc=false</parameter>: &gi-doc-disable;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ssh_agent=false</parameter>: Disable the ssh-agent "
"implementation of this package.  This implementation is intended to replace "
"the ssh-agent implementation of <xref linkend='gnome-keyring'/>, but it "
"turns out the replacement still has some unresolved issue."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ssh_agent=false</parameter>: Desabilite a implementação ssh-"
"agent deste pacote. Essa implementação é destinada a substituir a "
"implementação ssh-agent do <xref linkend='gnome-keyring'/>, mas a "
"substituição ainda tem alguns problemas não resolvidos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/gcr4.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D crypto=gnutls</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"gnutls\" role=\"nodep\"/> installed and wish to use it instead of "
"<xref linkend=\"libgcrypt\" role=\"nodep\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D crypto=gnutls</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"gnutls\" role=\"nodep\"/> instalado e desejar usá-lo em vez de "
"<xref linkend=\"libgcrypt\" role=\"nodep\"/>."

